Setting up the Ostrich for the LM, SMEC, or SBEC

----------

The Ostrich is an eprom emulator. That is, it's a device that appears to the ECU as an eprom, but can be programmed by an outside PC.

For more info on the Ostrich, see Moates.net";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1423950677;s:8:"modified";i:1426002176;}s:7:"creator";s:9:"Rob Lloyd";s:4:"user";s:8:"shelgame";s:11:"last_change";a:7:{s:4:"date";i:1426002176;s:2:"ip";s:15:"205.144.100.200";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:15:"use-the-ostrich";s:4:"user";s:8:"shelgame";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:8:"shelgame";s:9:"Rob Lloyd";}}}